{
 "encounter_id": "00885",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, my tummy has been swelling up over the past few weeks, and I feel full after only a few bites."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm sorry to hear that. Let's go through it step by step. When did the swelling begin?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About six weeks ago. It's gradual, my trousers are getting tight."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the feeling of fullness, is it every meal?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Almost every meal. I eat a few bites and that's it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you lost any weight, or had nausea or vomiting?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I think I've lost a little weight, but no vomiting."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What about your bowels? Any change, or any blood?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No blood. Bowels are as usual."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What medicines do you take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Omeprazole, 20 mg, once a day. Amlodipine, 5 mg, once a day. And calcium and vitamin D tablets."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Reflux, for about ten years. High blood pressure. And osteoporosis, diagnosed last year."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Do you drink alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A glass of wine with dinner, now and then."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your pulse, blood pressure and weight. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 80, blood pressure 128 over 80, temperature 36.7, oxygen 98 percent, weight 61 kilograms."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is the weight all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll compare it with your last visit. Now please lie back so I can feel your tummy. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All right.",
   "pause": 16.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your abdomen is distended, with some fullness in the upper part, and no tenderness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it serious? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Early fullness and swelling need proper investigation, and I'm not able to say what it is from the examination alone."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What will you do? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll arrange blood tests and an ultrasound scan of your abdomen, and I'd also like you to see a stomach specialist."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A specialist? That sounds worrying. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's to make sure we don't miss anything, because the fullness and weight loss need an explanation. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I understand. How long will it take? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The scan within two weeks, and I'll see you after the results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All right. Thank you for being straight with me. ~"
  }
 ],
